      "text": "Given the polynomial equation \\(x^3 - 5x^2 + 6x - 9 = 0\\) with roots \\(r\\), \\(s\\), and \\(t\\), we aim to compute the expression \\(\\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s}\\).\n\nFirst, by Vieta's formulas, we know:\n\\[\nr + s + t = 5,\n\\]\n\\[\nrs + rt + st = 6,\n\\]\n\\[\nrst = 9.\n\\]\n\nWe need to compute \\(\\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s}\\). To do this, we express each term in the given expression in terms of \\(r\\), \\(s\\), and \\(t\\).\n\n\\[\n\\frac{rs}{t} = \\frac{rs \\cdot s}{s \\cdot t} = \\frac{(rs)s}{st} = \\frac{rs}{t} = \\frac{rs}{t},\n\\]\n\\[\n\\frac{st}{r} = \\frac{st \\cdot r}{r \\cdot t} = \\frac{(st)r}{rt} = \\frac{st}{r},\n\\]\n\\[\n\\frac{tr}{s} = \\frac{tr \\cdot s}{s \\cdot t} = \\frac{(tr)s}{st} = \\frac{tr}{s}.\n\\]\n\nNotice that:\n\\[\n\\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s} = \\frac{rs \\cdot s}{st} + \\frac{st \\cdot r}{rt} + \\frac{tr \\cdot s}{st} = \\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s}.\n\\]\n\nThus, the expression simplifies to:\n\\[\n\\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s}.\n\\]\n\nWe need to find the value of this expression. Consider the polynomial \\(P(x) = x^3 - 5x^2 + 6x - 9\\). By Vieta's formulas, \\(r\\), \\(s\\), and \\(t\\) are roots of this polynomial. We need to find the value of:\n\\[\n\\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s}.\n\\]\n\nUsing the identity for the sum of the reciprocals of the roots and the product of the roots, we can express the desired value as:\n\\[\n\\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s} = \\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s}.\n\\]\n\nBy symmetry and the properties of polynomial roots, we can use the fact that for a polynomial \\(x^3 + ax^2 + bx + c = 0\\), the sum of the products of the roots taken two at a time is \\(b/a\\) and the product of the roots is \\(-c/a\\).\n\nIn our case, the polynomial is \\(x^3 - 5x^2 + 6x - 9\\), so:\n\\[\n\\frac{rs}{t} + \\frac{st}{r} + \\frac{tr}{s} = \\frac{6}{1} = 6.\n\\]\n\nThus, the value of the expression is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{6}.\n\\]",
